==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|cmn|en}} {{l|cmn|揚子江|sc=Hant}} / {{l|cmn|扬子江|sc=Hans}} (Yángzǐ Jiāng), older Chinese name of the river.

===Alternative forms===
* [[Yangzi]]

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The longest river in [[China]] that flows to the [[East China Sea]] north of [[Shanghai]].

====Synonyms====
* [[Chang Jiang]]
* [[Blue River]]
* [[Long River]]

====Derived terms====
* [[Yangtzean]]

